### 阶段 14 账号安全接口示例
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userToken = replace-with-user-token
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-token
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 本人修改密码；成功后包括当前 Token 在内的全部旧 Token 失效
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "replace-current-password",
  "newPassword": "replace-new-password"
}

### 本人撤销全部 Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/tokens/revoke-all
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 管理员分页查询活动普通用户
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?role=USER&status=ACTIVE&page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 管理员变更用户角色；管理员不能降低自己的角色
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "ADMIN",
  "version": 0
}

### 管理员设置一次性密码；目标用户下次登录后只能先改密
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/password-reset
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "replace-temporary-password",
  "version": 0
}

### 管理员解除临时锁定；不会把 DISABLED 账号改为 ACTIVE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 0
}

### 管理员撤销指定用户全部 Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/tokens/revoke-all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
